 234+ 24C8              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 235+ 24C8              ; Resident module registry for dynamically placed overlays.
 236+ 24C8              ; IDs 1..4 are pinned (X86IO/X86ALU/X86DEV/X86EXEC). IDs 5..15 may own
 237+ 24C8              ; one allocator page in 08h..0Fh. The registry stores physical page numbers;
